spes: provision the USIM from whichever slot holds it (0203).

all-2: modem online (DMS mode 0 accepted), NAS sees GSM at -63 dBm, searching; UIM: slot 1 card error, slot 2 card
present with one USIM "detected", primary GW none (0xffff). 0202 only provisioned slot 1. Now the first SIM/USIM that is
present and ready/detected, in any slot, becomes the primary GW application (Change Provisioning Session with its slot;
AID sent, never logged); the slot switch is only used when no such application exists. Card status is asked again ~5 s
after provisioning until the application is READY, then NAS registration is started (0202).

